ext&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""0"" y=""22"" class=""tour-idx""&gt;Δ^0  AA55  →  unit 0&lt;svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""1;0.12;0.12;0.12;0.12"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/&gt;&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""0"" y=""42"" class=""tour-idx""&gt;Δ^1  718E  →  unit 1&lt;svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.12;1;0.12;0.12;0.12"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/&gt;&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""0"" y=""62"" class=""tour-idx""&gt;Δ^2  EE11  →  unit 2&lt;svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.12;0.12;1;0.12;0.12"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/&gt;&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""0"" y=""82"" class=""tour-idx""&gt;Δ^3  CA35  →  unit 3&lt;svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.12;0.12;0.12;1;1"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/&gt;&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;/svg:g&gt;&lt;/svg:g&gt;&lt;svg:g id=""cla-equations"" transform=""translate(140, 1535)""&gt;&lt;svg:rect x=""0"" y=""0"" width=""1180"" height=""195"" rx=""6"" fill=""#f4f6f8"" stroke=""#ccc"" stroke-width=""1""/&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""18"" class=""legend-title""&gt;octal dialectic 16-pairs → 65536&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""38"" class=""octal""&gt;Aᵢ Bᵢ  (aₕ,aₗ)(bₕ,bₗ)  octal digits of the limb&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""56"" class=""octal""&gt;Gᵢ=Aᵢ·Bᵢ   Pᵢ=Aᵢ⊕Bᵢ   Cᵢ Sᵢ close the pair&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""74"" class=""octal""&gt;x ∈ 0…65535  one contiguous 16-bit address&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""92"" class=""octal""&gt;pair spans 8×8=64; full space 65536 addresses&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""110"" class=""octal""&gt;shape of 1/998001: linear index → structured runs&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""132"" class=""eq""&gt;CLA: Cᵢ₊₁=Gᵢ+Pᵢ·Cᵢ   Sᵢ=Pᵢ⊕Cᵢ&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""152"" class=""eq""&gt;look-ahead expands C on the G/P vector&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""14"" y=""172"" class=""eq""&gt;n width = how many 16-pairs fit the word&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""18"" class=""legend-title""&gt;I-222 proof roll-up&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""38"" class=""proof""&gt;boot mark: sector ends 55 AA → word 0xAA55&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""56"" class=""proof""&gt;AA XOR 55 = FF;  AA XNOR 55 = 00  (NULL)&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""74"" class=""proof""&gt;word turned XNOR = 00 00  (NULL NULL)&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""92"" class=""proof""&gt;still points of L: 0000 3333 5555 6666&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""110"" class=""proof""&gt;               9999 AAAA CCCC FFFF&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""128"" class=""proof""&gt;even-parity nibbles repeated (8 still words)&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""146"" class=""proof""&gt;square(FF)=5555 — a still point (carry-less)&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""400"" y=""168"" class=""proof""&gt;AA55 orbit under 1D1D: AA55→718E→EE11→CA35&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""18"" class=""legend-title""&gt;adder path · kernel&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""38"" class=""proof""&gt;AA55 nibbles [A,A,5,5] sum 30&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""56"" class=""proof""&gt;YHWH [10,5,6,5] sum 26  (share 10,5)&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""74"" class=""kernel""&gt;L(p)=rotl1⊕rotl3⊕rotl14  (linear part)&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""92"" class=""kernel""&gt;K(p,C)=L(p)⊕C   delta = K(·, const)&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""110"" class=""kernel""&gt;const 0x1D1D → AA55 period 4&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""128"" class=""kernel""&gt;const 0x1D   → every word period 8&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""146"" class=""kernel""&gt;tour lights unit s on orbit word s&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""780"" y=""168"" class=""kernel""&gt;deterministic replay; mask keeps width&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;/svg:g&gt;&lt;svg:g id=""cla-legend"" transform=""translate(140, 118)""&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""0"" y=""0"" class=""sig-g""&gt;G generate&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""110"" y=""0"" class=""sig-p""&gt;P propagate&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""230"" y=""0"" class=""sig-c""&gt;C carry&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""330"" y=""0"" class=""sig-s""&gt;S sum&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""420"" y=""0"" class=""sig-ab""&gt;A/B data&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;/svg:g&gt;&lt;/svg:g&gt;&lt;svg:text x=""140"" y=""1755"" class=""small""&gt;I-222: variables as octal dialectic 16-pairs on 65536; tour follows AA55 orbit under K(·,1D1D) (period 4); each step lights one unit/nibble of the A A 5 5 path; still points of L and NULL NULL squared&lt;/svg:text&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;"</c>

